sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as FireFly Admin
    participant API as FireFly API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant DBA as Databricks Admin
    participant Databricks as Databricks

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over Admin,DB: Automated Steps
        Admin->>API: POST /api/admin/add-member
        API->>DB: Check user exists
        DB-->>API: User found
        API->>DB: Create member record
        Note right of DB: organizationId, userId, role
        DB-->>API: Member created
        API-->>Admin: Success response
    end

    rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
        Note over DBA,Databricks: Manual Steps
        Admin->>DBA: Request user access
        DBA->>Databricks: Create user in Account
        DBA->>Databricks: Add user to org group
        Note right of Databricks: Grants Unity Catalog access
        DBA-->>Admin: User setup complete
    end

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note over Admin,DB: Automated Steps
        Admin->>API: POST /api/admin/databricks/accounts/map-scim-user
        API->>Databricks: GET /api/2.0/preview/scim/v2/Users
        Databricks-->>API: User SCIM ID
        API->>DB: Update user.databricksScimId
        DB-->>API: Updated
        API-->>Admin: SCIM mapping complete
    end
